| item.name                 | Human-readable item                       |
| item.purchased            | Current prop value                        |
| target item               | ID lookup result                          |
| previousItems             | State used to calculate next value       |
| nextItems                 | Proposed next state                       |
| JavaScript error          | Runtime/code problem                      |
+---------------------------+-------------------------------------------+


