and remove it once debugging is complete.


================================================================================
TROUBLESHOOTING TABLE
================================================================================

+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| ISSUE                    | CHECK                                      |
+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| Checkbox won't change    | checked + onChange + callback              |
| Handler undefined        | Prop name chain                            |
| Wrong item changes       | ID supplied to callback                    |
| Nothing changes          | ID value/type match                        |
| Style doesn't change     | Conditional class + CSS                    |
| State behaves oddly      | Direct mutation                            |
| Log appears stale        | State timing/render snapshot               |
| Too many logs            | Logging during render                      |
+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+


